                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "Again, would only recommend this game on sale, as 20 dollars feels like too high of a price tag. That said, this game is my absolute favorite in the series that I've played thus far (I've played up to game 8.) Gorgeous visuals, very interesting and fascinating story. It really polishes everything from the first game to give it a special sort of shine, and I'm honestly a little sad that the series peaked with the second game out of 16 (This is an assumption because I've only played up to game 8, and game 8 was very unenjoyable.) \n\nThis game also features what I believe to be the smoothest teaser/transition between games. :)",
